    "title": "Drone strike in Sudan's West Kordofan kills at least 80, Somali diaspora fears for relatives",
    "original_title": "SUUDAAN: Duqayn dishay 80 qof, iyadoo laga cabsi qabo in dad Soomaali ah ay ku jiraan khasaaraha",
